  "coverage_summary": "The suite covers login flows (valid, invalid, and remember checkbox interactions) starting on the login page (page_0) and primary dashboard/navigation actions on the index page (page_1). It verifies navigation to the dashboard, interactions with the user dropdown and message link, and access to the tasks overview. Notable gaps: there are no explicit tests for each individual task or message item with multiline keys (Task 1..4, New Comment entries, or user-specific links that include complex formatting), no backend/error message content checks, and persistence of the 'remember' state across sessions is not covered because session persistence was not represented in the explored pages."
